{"path":"string/basic_string_view/contains","title":"std::basic_string_view<CharT,Traits>::contains","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_string_view&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>contains","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view/contains","section":"string","kind":"page","summary":"Checks if the string view contains the given substring, where","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> contains<span class=\"br0\">(</span> basic_string_view sv <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> contains<span class=\"br0\">(</span> CharT c <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\" id=\"Version_3\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> contains<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> CharT<span class=\"sy2\">*</span> s <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (3) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Checks if the string view contains the given substring, where \